// The entry point. Everything reachable from here is compiled.
//
// Three trees, and they answer three different questions. `agent` is what the
// coding tool loads: who reviews, what runs, which skills exist. `concept` is
// how the editor fits together and why. `shape` mirrors `src`, one document per
// directory of code, and says what each part actually is.
from ./agent export *
from ./shape export *
